## What We Are Building

Turning the "Sandy the Hourglass" YouTube channel from blind posting into a measured, self-improving growth loop, and fixing the actual content that underperforms. Today's arc: diagnosed WHY reach doesn't convert (retention below median), verified a coder's subtractive fix of the broken learning loop, and hand-rebuilt the Car Wash short as a tighter 9:16 recut from the Director's own timeline edit — then uploaded it to the channel with the correct metadata/playlist discipline.

