## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Channel avatar re-crop** — confirmed by: og:image source was 1024×1024 (not low-res); real problem = busy logo illegible at 48px. Cropped source art to Sandy's face (ffmpeg), gave Director the file. Он залил сам.
- **Retention diagnosis (data-backed)** — confirmed by: YouTube Analytics API `relativeRetentionPerformance` on 4 aged shorts, ALL ≤ median (Car Wash bottom-15% at 0.15; Red Tape ~0.47). Winners 1200+ views are REAL (Red Tape analytics 1248 ≈ public 1253). The 1000-vs-10 short-vs-long gap is structural (Shorts feed firehose vs long-form zero cold discovery); subs weak (~0.1-0.2%, and only median-retention shots converted at all).
- **Analytics API LAG confirmed** — confirmed by: recent shorts read false-zero in API (Tennis public 1443 vs API 15) but OLD control matched public → it's a ~2-3 day processing lag, NOT fake views. subsGained ALSO lags.
- **Car Wash exact drop-off point** — confirmed by: fine retention curve. Steepest single fall 5.3→6.0s; exodus window 5-15s; half the audience gone by 12s. First ~4s hold.
- **Learning-loop VERIFY (coder's claim)** — confirmed by runtime: hook `training-capture.cjs` DELETED (grep 0, file gone), inbox `training-inbox.md` gone but distilled into ~20 skills + archived first, HoG metric fix real (`youtube-stats.ts` no longer hardcodes 0 — reads `reach?.impressions ?? 0` from `channel_reports` via `readReachMetricsFromArchive`; tsc EXIT=0, 13/13 tests). Real impressions exist: Red Tape 39, Car Wash 30, etc. in `channel_reach_basic_a1`.
- **Car Wash 9:16 recut built** — confirmed by: ffmpeg 2-pass. 15 kept shots (Director's `episode.metadata.excluded_shot_ids` = sh02-06,09,10,13,17,18,26 EXACTLY matched his UI), numeric order, 60.0s, 1080×1920 center-crop 9:16 + same music (from old final_cut audio) + 2s fade-out. Frames sane (checked 2s + 30s).
- **Upload to channel** — confirmed by: YouTube Data API resumable upload → id `sp9Q06AZPu8`, verified processed/succeeded, unlisted (Director then scheduled it Aug 1 + added to Shorts playlist himself).
- **Episode metadata phantom fixed (q23)** — confirmed by: PATCH status 200. `youtube_video_id` undefined→`2efpY_JPYUo` (real long); `youtube_short_id` `qQx1IgopGd0`(deleted)→`sp9Q06AZPu8`. Prev ids kept in `_prev_deleted`.
- **Playlist-attribution skill rule** — confirmed by: committed `d39610b6`, pushed to origin. Added to `shorts-longform-distribution` (BOTH trees) as "second invariant upload step".

