- **Seriality → sub-conversion** (backlog memory) — untested; design Airport 1-4 as counter-test vs standalone gags.
- **Retention sweep** across recent winners (Tennis/PowerFan/Smartphone) — was lag-blocked; Tennis/PowerFan cleared today, Smartphone still lagging.

