## Environment & Setup Notes

- **Owner-token pattern (reused all session):** mint access token from `.env.local` `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`+`GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET`+`YOUTUBE_REFRESH_TOKEN` (YouTube/brand) or `GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN` (Drive). Run `node --input-type=module -e '...'` from `webapp/`. Sees Unlisted/Private/scheduled + Analytics + Reporting + Drive download (`drive/v3/files/{id}?alt=media`).
- **Supabase** service_role REST for `episodes`/`assets`/`channel_reports`. Columns: episodes = `episode_code,title_working,metadata`(no title/episode_number); assets = `filename,file_type,drive_file_id,drive_web_view_url,content,metadata`(no name/type).
- **ffmpeg/ffprobe** at winget Gyan path. node on Windows needs `C:/...` forward-slash paths, NOT git-bash `/c/...`.
- **inject-time hook** now injects `[now: HH:MM Dubai]` each turn — use it, don't fabricate time.
- **git**: master pushed to origin at `d39610b6`. No feature branch. Skill edits allowed in `===1===` (config carve-out).
